      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm actually fairly certain some of the footage/images we used in that stream were from iFacialMocap!\nThe implementation we plan on using involves OSC input into VRChat, which means you could do this-- but you'd have to build your own middle layer application to receive data from iFacialMocap and translate it into OSC data to pass into VRChat. Doing this permits users to build support for whatever device/application/etc they'd like.\nNotably, this is just the plan-- the implementation method isn't finalized.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
