  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As to prior of the dev update when they announced face tracking for desktop users, i knew there was a spark to happen but when i noticed they said for webcams this shooked me.\nMost vtubers who stream on vrchat and then outside does not use a webcam for their head and facial tracking. This needs to be told by the team as i know several people use iFacialMocap from their iPhone X+.\nWe need an update that has the function on allowing I phones to track ur face than just a webcam as webcams are not a good system to track.",
